  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven expression is 19 * 24 * 8 * 4 * 6 * 40\n\n**Option (1):**\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get:\n\n19 × __**24 ÷ 8**__ + 4 - 6 = 40 \n\n⇒ __**19 × 3**__ + 4 - 6 = 40\n\n⇒ __**57 + 4**__ - 6 = 40\n\n⇒ 61 - 6 = 40 \n\n⇒ **55 ≠ 40**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (2):**\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get:\n\n19 - __**24 ÷ 8**__ + 4 × 6 = 40 \n\n⇒ 19 - 3 + __**4 × 6**__ = 40\n\n⇒ **19** - 3 **+ 24** = 40\n\n⇒ __**19 + 24 **__- 3 = 40\n\n⇒ 43 - 3 = 40\n\n⇒ **40 = 40**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option (3):**\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get:\n\n19 - **__24 ÷ 8__** × 4 + 6 = 40 \n\n⇒ 19 - __**3 × 4**__ + 6 = 40 \n\n⇒ **19** -12 **+ 6** = 40\n\n⇒ **__19 + 6__** - 12 = 40\n\n⇒ 25 - 12 = 40\n\n⇒ **13 ≠ 40**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (4):**\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get:\n\n19 - 24 + **__8 × 4 __**+ 6 = 40 \n\n⇒ 19 - 24 **+ __32 + 6__** = 40\n\n⇒ **__19 +32 + 6__** - 24 = 40\n\n⇒ __**51 + 6**__ - 24 = 40\n\n⇒ 57 - 24 = 40\n\n⇒ **33 ≠ 40**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"option (2)\".**",
